# Local run trails — deliberately NOT committed.
#
# These are per-machine artifacts: committing them would dirty the working tree on
# every gated commit and on every `--force-unlock`, which trains people to ignore the
# gate's own output. The REFERENCE artifacts in this directory (migration-order.txt,
# renumber-map.json, fidelity-report.json, local-fp*.txt) ARE committed — see
# ../../README.md for the split and the reason for it.
*.log
gate-last-run.json
fidelity-delta.json
local-fp1.txt
local-fp2.txt
local-fp3.txt
# Local-vs-local control fixtures used ONLY to prove the gate can still say PASS.
# Deliberately not committed: they are not a staging capture and must never be read as one.
local-control-*

# Self-test scratch artifacts from the gate harness (never committed).
zz-*

# FIX-Task-64 self-test scratch (never committed).
local-digest.txt
local-digest-prev.txt
ext-owned-names.txt
